# Ryuuiisou (All Green) does not require Hatsu (6z) and does not also score Chinitsu
# (rules.md §2.2, §4 item 35).
# Seat 1 holds 223344s 666s 888s 2s (all green tiles, zero 6z!); Seat 0 discards 2s -> Seat 1 rons 2s!
# Scoring for Seat 1 (non-dealer, South):
#   Natural Yakuman: ryuuiisou:1 (1x Yakuman = 32000 from Seat 0).

[meta]
name: ryuuiisou_without_hatsu
title: Ryuuiisou made purely of green souzu without Hatsu scores 1x Yakuman
